y-robots-says-she-would-do-it-again-because-she-believes-she-has-more-rights-than-a-robot/articleshow/135407173.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T22:29:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135407319,imgsize-36476.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California restaurant wins $60,391 over Masters catering bill; court upholds just $1,950 in extra fees]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135391758.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A legal battle erupted between a California restaurant and the family of a golfer regarding a surprise catering bill. The eatery served meals during the prestigious Masters tournament without prior discussion of costs. After leaving prematurely, the family was charged nearly $75,000, which they contested in court. Ultimately, the jury awarded the restaurant $60,391, albeit the request for extra attorney fees was mostly denied.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-restaurant-catered-meals-for-a-golfers-family-at-the-masters-without-agreeing-on-a-price-then-sent-a-74960-bill-after-a-60391-jury-award-appeals-judges-upheld-just-1950-in-extra-fees/articleshow/135391758.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-restaurant-catered-meals-for-a-golfers-family-at-the-masters-without-agreeing-on-a-price-then-sent-a-74960-bill-after-a-60391-jury-award-appeals-judges-upheld-just-1950-in-extra-fees/articleshow/135391758.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T22:04:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135391913,imgsize-1714149.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NASA-funded study reveals 4.1-billion-year-old history of pink Martian rock found in Sahara]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135396990.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Discovered in the vast Sahara Desert, the meteorite Teghaza 001 is over four billion years old and is confirmed to be a Martian rock via isotopic studies. This intriguing specimen reveals a volcanic history intertwined with water activity, indicating a complex water cycle on Mars. As researchers delve deeper into its origins, they are unraveling vital insights into the planet's early environmental conditions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/space/in-2022-an-800-gram-pink-rock-was-found-in-the-sahara-desert-nasa-funded-researchers-have-now-confirmed-it-came-from-mars-more-than-4-1-billion-years-ago-and-preserves-signs-of-the-planets-ancient-water/articleshow/135396990.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/space/in-2022-an-800-gram-pink-rock-was-found-in-the-sahara-desert-nasa-funded-researchers-have-now-confirmed-it-came-from-mars-more-than-4-1-billion-years-ago-and-preserves-signs-of-the-planets-ancient-water/articleshow/135396990.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T22:04:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135397162,imgsize-741262.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[She left behind her dream of a career in law to build a life in a Nepalese village]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135400099.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Madeleine Jaye purchased a £170,000 property in Yorkshire while maintaining a lifestyle between Britain and Nepal. Following her father's death, she reevaluated career goals and embraced a simpler life. Living in a rural village in Nepal brings both challenges and contentment, influencing her financial decisions. She operates a personal assistant business based in the UK, allowing her to balance work and life in Nepal.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/she-left-behind-her-dream-of-a-career-in-law-to-build-a-life-in-a-nepalese-village-but-at-25-her-300-a-month-lifestyle-has-helped-her-buy-a-170000-home-in-yorkshire/articleshow/135400099.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/she-left-behind-her-dream-of-a-career-in-law-to-build-a-life-in-a-nepalese-village-but-at-25-her-300-a-month-lifestyle-has-helped-her-buy-a-170000-home-in-yorkshire/articleshow/135400099.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T22:03:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135400099,imgsize-122606.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Afghans facing deportation from US include relatives of those who worked alongside American forces; plane will take them to Pakistan]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135405789.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/afghans-facing-deportation-from-us-include-relatives-of-those-who-worked-alongside-american-forces-plane-will-take-them-to-pakistan/articleshow/135405789.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/afghans-facing-deportation-from-us-include-relatives-of-those-who-worked-alongside-american-forces-plane-will-take-them-to-pakistan/articleshow/135405789.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T21:42:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.