45-52-carat-hope-diamond-to-the-smithsonian-museum-and-sent-it-through-the-us-mail-in-a-plain-brown-package-paying-postage-and-insurance-of-about-145/articleshow/135387342.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1958-jeweller-harry-winston-donated-the-45-52-carat-hope-diamond-to-the-smithsonian-museum-and-sent-it-through-the-us-mail-in-a-plain-brown-package-paying-postage-and-insurance-of-about-145/articleshow/135387342.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T19:01:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135387655,imgsize-1065770.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[82% disapprove of Trump. So why are fewer Indian Americans identifying as Democrats?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135401389.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ahead of the November 3 US midterms, fresh polling shows Indian-Americans strongly favour Democrats on the economy and in congressional races. But a six-year decline in Democratic identification, growing political exhaustion and dissatisfaction with both parties suggest a more complicated relationship with the party.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/82-disapprove-of-trump-so-why-are-fewer-indian-americans-identifying-as-democrats/articleshow/135401389.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/82-disapprove-of-trump-so-why-are-fewer-indian-americans-identifying-as-democrats/articleshow/135401389.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T18:48:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Arghya Prasun Roychowdhury</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135401389,imgsize-58792.cms"/></item></channel></rss>